    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551950/extras/425299f630f21e852f062a742e70e33b.avif?t=1749638727\" width=800 height=190 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Tribes\u00a0</strong>is a real-time strategy game where survival means outsmarting, outgrowing, and out-fighting every other tribe on the island. Can you rise from humble beginnings to build the strongest tribe, or will your people be wiped out by rival clans and wild dangers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with just a small group of villagers. Gather resources, construct buildings, and train warriors as you grow your settlement into a thriving, battle-hardened tribe. Every choice matters\u2014will you expand quickly, build up powerful defenses, or strike first and crush your enemies before they gain strength?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy, master your own playstyle, and lead your people to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Conquer</strong> \u2013 Grow your village, manage your resources, and raise a powerful army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Battles</strong> \u2013 Take command in fast-paced skirmishes where every move counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player Campaign</strong> \u2013 Battle against ruthless AI tribes in a challenging, evolving world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World</strong> \u2013 Changing terrain, weather, and events keep every game fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tribal Warfare</strong> \u2013 Unlock unique units and abilities to shape your tribe\u2019s destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE DISCORD SERVER!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551950/extras/40171e9f97c7abd2c7115b427b46b295.avif?t=1749638727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>Arxar and MrChezzerz,</strong><i>\u00a0Tribes</i> brings classic RTS gameplay with a fresh competitive twist. Only the strongest tribe will survive. Will it be yours?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in version Beta 0.1.0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551950/extras/425299f630f21e852f062a742e70e33b.avif?t=1749638727\" width=800 height=190 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Tribes\u00a0</strong>is a real-time strategy game where survival means outsmarting, outgrowing, and out-fighting every other tribe on the island. Can you rise from humble beginnings to build the strongest tribe, or will your people be wiped out by rival clans and wild dangers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with just a small group of villagers. Gather resources, construct buildings, and train warriors as you grow your settlement into a thriving, battle-hardened tribe. Every choice matters\u2014will you expand quickly, build up powerful defenses, or strike first and crush your enemies before they gain strength?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy, master your own playstyle, and lead your people to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Conquer</strong> \u2013 Grow your village, manage your resources, and raise a powerful army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Battles</strong> \u2013 Take command in fast-paced skirmishes where every move counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player Campaign</strong> \u2013 Battle against ruthless AI tribes in a challenging, evolving world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World</strong> \u2013 Changing terrain, weather, and events keep every game fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tribal Warfare</strong> \u2013 Unlock unique units and abilities to shape your tribe\u2019s destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE DISCORD SERVER!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551950/extras/40171e9f97c7abd2c7115b427b46b295.avif?t=1749638727\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>Arxar and MrChezzerz,</strong><i>\u00a0Tribes</i> brings classic RTS gameplay with a fresh competitive twist. Only the strongest tribe will survive. Will it be yours?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in version Beta 0.1.0</p>",
